WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Set a used plastic bottle beside the plant.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Cut off the base. Keep the cap.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Make a few small holes in the cap, then screw it back on.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Bury the bottle neck down, with its open rim just above the soil.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Fill the open top. Water seeps slowly through the buried cap.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
As the bottle empties, the damp patch spreads through the soil around the roots.
